00:00:40.825 --> 00:00:42.668
If they bought five pounds of fudge

00:00:42.668 --> 00:00:45.459
and each person wants five
sevenths of a pound of fudge

00:00:45.459 --> 00:00:47.575
then how many people can
get to share the fudge?

00:00:47.575 --> 00:00:49.548
What going on in Nancy's life,

00:00:49.548 --> 00:00:52.264
that she needs to buy
five pounds of fudge?

00:00:52.264 --> 00:00:53.222
This equals a whole.

00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:55.306
This right here plus this equals a whole.

00:00:55.306 --> 00:00:57.284
My answer is three point five.

00:00:57.284 --> 00:01:00.072
I really want chocolate right now.

00:01:00.072 --> 00:01:01.027
That's cheating.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:03.043
