00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:04.394
Seven friends.

00:01:04.394 --> 00:01:05.352
I got

00:01:05.352 --> 00:01:06.543
seven?

00:01:06.543 --> 00:01:08.192
It's seven.

00:01:08.192 --> 00:01:09.659
- [Female narrator] The
correct answer is seven.

00:01:09.659 --> 00:01:11.909
(cheering)

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:14.365
Seven?
What?

00:01:15.430 --> 00:01:16.543
Seven?

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:17.498
